{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"題名は、ゆったんのをいじりました（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"布団を取られました（泣）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は早朝から撮影で集合が早かったから、せいらりんの家に泊まったんだけど急遽、ゆったんも来ることになって一つの布団で一緒に寝たのね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝る前まではちゃんと布団かかってたのに…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『寒い…』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と思って起きようと思った15分前に目が覚めて気付いたら、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『布団がない…』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隣を見ると、布団に包まったゆったんがいるではないか。。泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうゆったんとは一緒に寝たくないと思った昨日。。。涙"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これを本人に言ったら、『まいやんちゃんごめんー！また一緒に寝よう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しょうがないなぁ〜\n(気が向いたら)また一緒に寝ようね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だってこんなに仲良しだもん！\n洋服だってお揃いだもんね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/18/dvc00661.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったんには言ってないけど、一回顔に手が飛んできたのは内緒。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結果、斎藤優里は寝相が悪いことがわかりました(；∀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話しを戻すと、昨日は朝から仕事でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途中軽い貧血になったけど、最後まで楽しかったです。(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのスタッフさん方、本当にありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完成が楽しみだな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は久々一日offだったので、ずぅーーーーーっと寝てました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もお仕事なので、たくさん休んで明日からまた頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20日〜25日はクリスマス スペシャルウィーク☆彡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は21日と25日に出ます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二日間出られるって…\nみんなにもたくさん会えるってこと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しいクリスマスにならなくてよかったぁ(；∀；)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年のクリスマスはみんなと過ごせるなんて幸せや〜(；∀；)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと3日待てばみんなに会える！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非、クリスマスウィークは乃木坂46と一緒に過ごしましょう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragr